asset:        653-footage-eps-as-layer.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture: base project plus a 64x48 pt EPS (written by the contributor, referenced by a neutral path, not included) added as a layer in C
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-18 by vangel76
notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 from scratch (scripted changes) as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The project container is the generated file with the media folder path and the machine name in the footage alias replaced by neutral strings of the same length; the XMP packet after it was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project to keep the fixtures small.
